{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"deliveries","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncQueue","preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/AsyncQueues\/documentation\/AsyncQueues\/AsyncQueue"},{"text":"<[","kind":"text"},{"text":"EventRecord","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events11EventRecordV","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventRecord"},{"text":"]> { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Batches not yet read wait in a buffer of the newest ","type":"text"},{"code":"capacity","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" batches; a slower reader","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"misses the older ones, and reads ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/InMemoryDestination\/records","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" for what is kept. The sequence ends once the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"destination and every copy of it are gone and every batch kept has been read.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"One task reads the batches at a time; it can fan each one out to the rest of the app. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"first iterator to read holds them until its iteration ends or it is released; a second"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reader meanwhile waits its turn, logging a warning once, then reads on from the next batch,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so the first gets every batch in order. A reader cancelled while it waits returns "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"remoteSource":{"fileName":"InMemoryDestination.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Destinations\/InMemoryDestination.swift#L108"},"title":"deliveries","roleHeading":"Instance Property","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"deliveries"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV","text":"AsyncQueue"},{"kind":"text","text":"<["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events11EventRecordV","text":"EventRecord"},{"kind":"text","text":"]>"}],"symbolKind":"property","modules":[{"name":"Destinations"}],"externalID":"s:12Destinations19InMemoryDestinationV10deliveries11AsyncQueues0F5QueueVySay6Events11EventRecordVGGvp","role":"symbol"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations","doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/InMemoryDestination"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/InMemoryDestination\/deliveries","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/destinations\/inmemorydestination\/deliveries"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Each batch as it is received, whole, for a reader that waits for a delivery: a view that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"refreshes, or a test that reads once a batch arrives."}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations/InMemoryDestination/records":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/InMemoryDestination\/records","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The records kept, in the order received, across batches."}],"url":"\/documentation\/destinations\/inmemorydestination\/records","type":"topic"